	"short_name": "Debts",
	"description": "Track what you owe — to friends, shops, cards and loans — with the place it happened, and a plan to pay it all off. Works offline; your data stays on your device. — سجّل ديونك ومكان كل دين، وخطة لسدادها. يعمل دون إنترنت وبياناتك على جهازك.",
